      "filename": "Strait of Malacca (MODIS 2025-08-25).jpg",
      "title": "File:Strait of Malacca (MODIS 2025-08-25).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/Strait_of_Malacca_%28MODIS_2025-08-25%29.jpg",
